    .steps {\n+        display: grid;\n+        gap: 10px;\n+      }\n+\n+      .step {\n+        display: grid;\n+        grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr;\n+        gap: 12px;\n+        align-items: start;\n+        padding: 12px;\n+        border-radius: 16px;\n+        border: 1px solid #dbe6ef;\n+        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);\n+      }\n+\n+      .step-index {\n+        width: 34px;\n+        height: 34px;\n+        border-radius: 50%;\n+        display: grid;\n+        place-items: center;\n+        font-size: 13px;\n+        font-weight: 800;\n+        color: white;\n+        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #4b85b7 0%, #2a6ca3 100%);\n+      }\n+\n+      .step strong {\n+        display: block;\n+        margin-bottom: 5px;\n+        font-size: 14px;\n+      }\n+\n+      .step span {\n+        color: var(--muted);\n+        font-size: 13px;\n+        line-height: 1.62;\n+      }\n+\n+      .flow {\n+        display: grid;\n+        gap: 10px;\n+        padding: 14px;\n+        border-radius: 18px;\n+        border: 1px solid #d8e5ee;\n+        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(252, 254, 255, 0.97) 0%, rgba(240, 246, 251, 0.92) 100%);\n+      }\n+\n+      .flow-row {\n+        display: flex;\n+        flex-wrap: wrap;\n+        gap: 10px;\n+        align-items: center;\n+      }\n+\n+      .node,\n+      .arrow {\n+        padding: 10px 12px;\n+        border-radius: 14px;\n+        font-size: 13px;\n+        font-weight: 700;\n+      }\n+\n+      .node {\n+        background: #fff;\n+        border: 1px solid #d4e2ed;\n+      }\n+\n+      .node.claw {\n+        border-color: rgba(140, 79, 197, 0.42);\n+        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98) 0%, rgba(245, 237, 255, 0.94) 100%);\n+      }\n+\n+      .arrow {\n+        padding-inline: 0;\n+        color: #6f879d;\n+        background: transparent;\n+      }\n+\n+      .speech {\n+        padding: 16px 18px;\n+        border-radius: 18px;\n+        border: 1px solid #dbe7ef;\n+        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);\n+        color: #355069;\n+        font-size: 14px;\n+        line-height: 1.82;\n+      }\n+\n+      .speech strong {\n+        color: #1c4668;\n+      }\n+\n+      .arch-grid {\n+        display: grid;\n+        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n+        gap: 10px;\n+      }\n+\n+      .arch-box {\n+        border-radius: 16px;\n+        padding: 12px;\n+        border: 1px solid #d8e5ee;\n+        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);\n+      }\n+\n+      .arch-box h4 {\n+        margin: 0 0 6px;\n+        font-size: 14px;\n+      }\n+\n+      .arch-box p {\n+        margin: 0;\n+        color: var(--muted);\n+        font-size: 13px;\n+        line-height: 1.62;\n+      }\n+\n+      .focus-card {\n+        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98) 0%, rgba(244, 249, 253, 0.94) 100%);\n+      }\n+\n+      .focus-list {\n+        display: grid;\n+        gap: 10px;\n+        margin-top: 10px;\n+      }\n+\n+      .focus-item {\n+        display: grid;\n+        grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr;\n+        gap: 10px;\n+        align-items: start;\n+      }\n+\n+      .focus-num {\n+        width: 28px;\n+        height: 28px;\n+        border-radius: 50%;\n+        display: grid;\n+        place-items: center;\n+        font-size: 12px;\n+        font-weight: 800;\n+        color: #8a511e;\n+        background: var(--warn-soft);\n+      }\n+\n+      .focus-item span {\n+        color: var(--muted);\n+        font-size: 13px;\n+        line-height: 1.62;\n+      }\n+\n+      .footnote {\n+        color: var(--muted);\n+        font-size: 12px;\n+        line-height: 1.7;\n+      }\n+\n+      @media (max-width: 1100px) {\n+        .grid,\n+        .callouts,\n+        .arch-grid {\n+          grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n+        }\n+\n+        .hero-top,\n+        .story-header {\n+          flex-direction: column;\n+          align-items: start;\n+        }\n+\n+        .badges {\n+          justify-content: flex-start;\n+        }\n+      }\n+    </style>\n+  </head>\n+  <body>\n+    <div class=\"page\">\n+      <section class=\"hero\">\n+        <div class=\"hero-top\">\n+          <div>\n+            <h1>Liteasy x OpenClaw 路演答辩故事线</h1>\n+            <div class=\"subtitle\">\n+              这份页面把 Liteasy 的技术讲解整理成一条适合路演和答辩的故事线：\n+              先讲用户为什么需要，再讲产品怎么解决，最后讲我们如何借鉴 OpenClaw\n+              的 runtime 范式把这些能力稳定、可控地组织起来。\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"badges\">\n+            <span class=\"badge\">桌面科研工作台</span>\n+            <span class=\"badge\">OpenClaw-inspired runtime</span>\n+            <span class=\"badge\">T_IM 精读亮点</span>\n+            <span class=\"badge\">路演可直接使用</span>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"quote\">\n+          Liteasy 不是“把论文丢给 AI 问一问”的工具，而是一个把文献导入、精读、问答、\n+          可视化讲解和个性化学习串成闭环的桌面科研工作台。\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div class=\"callouts\">\n+          <div class=\"callout\">\n+            <h3>讲解原则</h3>\n+            <p>不要把未来蓝图讲成已经全部实现，要明确区分“当前原型已落地”和“明确的扩展方向”。</p>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"callout\">\n+            <h3>OpenClaw 关系</h3>\n+            <p>我们借鉴的是能力编排方式，而不是照搬它的产品外形或多聊天渠道入口。</p>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"callout\">\n+            <h3>最强亮点</h3>\n+            <p>`T_IM` 把普通 AI 问答升级成可回跳原文、连续划线、分层讲解的 AI 精读体验。</p>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </section>\n+\n+      <div class=\"grid\">\n+        <section class=\"panel\">\n+          <h2 class=\"section-title\">先统一口径</h2>\n+          <div class=\"section-subtitle\">上台前先把“什么已经有，什么是清晰路线”讲稳，后面整条故事线都会更顺。</div>\n+\n+          <div class=\"stack-grid\">\n+            <div class=\"stack-card\">\n+              <h3>当前仓库已能证明的技术栈</h3>\n+              <p>当前可以明确讲的真实技术栈，是 `Tauri 2 + React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Rust + Vitest`，并且已经有三栏工作台原型与基础状态切片。</p>\n+              <div class=\"chips\">\n+                <span class=\"chip good\">Tauri 2</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip good\">React 18</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip good\">TypeScript</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip good\">Vite</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip good\">Rust</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip good\">Vitest</span>\n+              </div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <div class=\"stack-card\">\n+              <h3>适合路演讲述的目标分层</h3>\n+              <p>未来扩展方向可以清晰讲成四层：本地能力层、运行时层、云端扩展层、智能能力层，但要保持“这是路线，不是假装已全部完成”。</p>\n+              <div class=\"chips\">\n+                <span class=\"chip\">Rust + SQLite</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip claw\">Skill / Action Registry</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip claw\">Allowlist / Direct Dispatch</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip\">NestJS + PostgreSQL</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip\">BullMQ + S3</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip\">双模型审计</span>\n+              </div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <div class=\"stack-card\">\n+              <h3>最重要的答辩提醒</h3>\n+              <p>推荐原句：<strong>“我们当前已经完成桌面工作台原型，底层扩展路线则按 OpenClaw 启发的 runtime 范式继续推进。”</strong></p>\n+              <div class=\"chips\">\n+                <span class=\"chip warn\">不要说成已全部实现</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip good\">强调原型已落地</span>\n+                <span class=\"chip claw\">强调范式借鉴</span>\n+              </div>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <h2 class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top: 18px\">我们向 OpenClaw 学什么</h2>\n+          <div class=\"matrix\">\n+            <table>\n+              <thead>\n+                <tr>\n+                  <th>OpenClaw Feature</th>\n+                  <th>Liteasy 对应讲法</th>\n+                  <th>路演价值</th>\n+                </tr>\n+              </thead>\n+              <tbody>\n+                <tr>\n+                  <td>Skills</td>\n+                  <td>把名词解释、论文问答、产物生成、设置修改收敛成可注册工作流</td>\n+                  <td>说明 AI 不是乱答，而是按任务类型走不同流程</td>\n+                </tr>\n+                <tr>\n+                  <td>Tools / Plugin</td>\n+                  <td>把系统能力做成结构化 action，把专注度与 TODO 做成插件扩展</td>\n+                  <td>说明软件可扩展，而且是可控扩展</td>\n+                </tr>\n+                <tr>\n+                  <td>Routing</td>\n+                  <td>不同模式、不同工作区、不同任务走不同链路</td>\n+                  <td>说明不是“一句话进来全靠模型猜”</td>\n+                </tr>\n+                <tr>\n+                  <td>Media</td>\n+                  <td>文本、导图、PPT、视频、播客、Concept Map、划线讲解</td>\n+                  <td>说明我们跟上了多模态效果范式</td>\n+                </tr>\n+                <tr>\n+                  <td>Session isolation</td>\n+                  <td>以工作区和已锁定文献集作为上下文边界</td>\n+                  <td>说明回答不会乱串上下文</td>\n+                </tr>\n+                <tr>\n+                  <td>Control UI / App</td>\n+                  <td>落在三栏桌面工作台，而不是纯聊天壳</td>\n+                  <td>说明产品形态更适合论文精读</td>\n+                </tr>\n+              </tbody>\n+            </table>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <div class=\"speech\" style=\"margin-top: 14px\">\n+            <strong>一句总括：</strong>\n+            我们借鉴 OpenClaw 的，不是它长什么样，而是它如何把 AI 能力组织成稳定、可控、可扩展的运行时。\n+          </div>\n+        </section>\n+\n+        <aside class=\"panel\">\n+          <h2 class=\"section-title\">答辩侧重点</h2>\n+          <div class=\"story-list\">\n+            <div class=\"story-card\">\n+              <h3>主讲人适合怎么讲</h3>\n+              <p>先讲痛点和用户动作，再讲三栏工作台与 T_IM 的精读体验，最后再落到 OpenClaw 范式与技术托底。</p>\n+            </div>\n+            <div class=\"story-card\">\n+              <h3>评委最容易听懂的点</h3>\n+              <p>“AI 回答不只在聊天框里结束，而是会回到 PDF 原文中连续划线、解释、跳转，并长出 Concept Map。”</p>\n+            </div>\n+            <div class=\"story-card\">\n+              <h3>技术成员最该守住的口径</h3>\n+              <p>桌面工作台是产品形态，OpenClaw runtime 是底层范式；两者不是谁替代谁，而是前者承载场景，后者承载能力组织。</p>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <div class=\"focus-card\" style=\"margin-top: 14px\">\n+          